@startuml Attendance Management System - Sequence Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 20
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
}

actor Teacher
participant "Web Interface" as UI
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Attendance Service" as Attendance
participant "Database" as DB

== Login Process ==
Teacher -> UI: Enter credentials
UI -> Auth: Validate credentials
Auth -> DB: Check user data
DB --> Auth: Return user info
Auth --> UI: Return auth token
UI --> Teacher: Show dashboard

== Mark Attendance ==
Teacher -> UI: Select class
UI -> Attendance: Get class students
Attendance -> DB: Fetch student list
DB --> Attendance: Return students
Attendance --> UI: Display student list

loop For each student
    Teacher -> UI: Mark attendance status
    UI -> Attendance: Save attendance
    Attendance -> DB: Store attendance record
    DB --> Attendance: Confirm save
    Attendance --> UI: Update display
end

== Generate Report ==
Teacher -> UI: Request report
UI -> Attendance: Generate report
Attendance -> DB: Fetch attendance data
DB --> Attendance: Return data
Attendance -> Attendance: Process data
Attendance --> UI: Display report
UI --> Teacher: Show report

@enduml 